  "worked_solution": "To evaluate the minor of ${v}_{21},$ we remove the second row and first column:\n\n$$\nV=[\\begin{aligned}\u2217 & 1 & 3i \\\\ 2 & \u2217 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & j & k\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${v}_{21}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{21} & =det[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3i \\\\ j & k\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3i \\\\ j & k\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot k-(3i)\\cdot j \\\\  & =k-3ij.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
